            {
              "type": "tool_use",
              "id": "toolu_01TVdPoPCjEMcG2HpWDzXYPR",
              "name": "ScheduleWakeup",
              "input": {
                "delaySeconds": 270,
                "reason": "等待 v9 数据收集到 50 条/GPU，当前 27/31/24，约 5 分钟后再检查",
                "prompt": "## 任务：v9 SR 采样（等到 50 条/GPU 再分析）\n\n### 背景\n服务器 cqa1-21977 上 v9 数据收集运行中（3 GPU）。上次检查时 ~25 条/GPU，需要等到 ~50 条。按 ~60-120s/task，预计还需 ~30-50 分钟。\n\n### 你要做的\n\n**Step 1: 轮询等待**（ssh_read_only）\n\n每 **5 分钟** 检查一次各 GPU 输出行数：\n```bash\ncd /root/autodl-tmp/rl-active-probe-fl\nfor dir in data/trajectories_v9_icl_cuda0 data/trajectories_v9_icl_cuda1 data/trajectories_v9_icl_cuda4; do\n  f=$(ls $dir/*.jsonl 2>/dev/null | head -1)\n  [ -n \"$f\" ] && echo \"$dir: $(wc -l < $f) lines\" || echo \"$dir: no file\"\ndone\n```\n\n当**至少 2 个 GPU 达到 50 条**时进入 Step 2。**最多轮询 30 分钟**（6 次），如果 30 分钟后还没到 50，就用当前数据。\n\n**Step 2: 详细分析**（ssh_read_only）\n\n```bash\ncd /root/autodl-tmp/rl-active-probe-fl\npython3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport json, glob, statistics\nfrom collections import Counter, defaultdict\n\nfiles = list(set(glob.glob('data/trajectories_v9_icl_cuda*/*.jsonl')))\nall_data = []\nper_gpu = {}\nfor f in sorted(files):\n    gpu_name = f.split('/')[-2]\n    items = [json.loads(line) for line in open(f)]\n    per_gpu[gpu_name] = items\n    all_data.extend(items)\n\ntotal = len(all_data)\nsuccess = sum(1 for d in all_data if d.get('reward', False))\nfailure = total - success\nprint(f'总计: {total} | 成功: {success} | 失败: {failure} | SR: {success/max(total,1)*100:.1f}%')\n\nfor gpu, items in sorted(per_gpu.items()):\n    s = sum(1 for d in items if d.get('reward', False))\n    print(f'  {gpu}: {len(items)} 条, SR {s}/{len(items)} = {s/max(len(items),1)*100:.1f}%')\n\nprint('\\n按 task_type:')\ntt_total = Counter()\ntt_success = Counter()\ntt_steps = defaultdict(list)\nfor d in all_data:\n    tt = d.get('task_type', 'unknown')\n    tt_total[tt] += 1\n    if d.get('reward', False): tt_success[tt] += 1\n    tt_steps[tt].append(d.get('steps', 0))\n\nfor tt in sorted(tt_total, key=lambda x: tt_total[x], reverse=True):\n    sr = tt_success[tt] / tt_total[tt] * 100\n    avg_s = sum(tt_steps[tt]) / len(tt_steps[tt])\n    print(f'  {tt}: {tt_success[tt]}/{tt_total[tt]} ({sr:.0f}%) avg_steps={avg_s:.1f}')\n\nfail_steps = [d['steps'] for d in all_data if not d.get('reward', False)]\nsucc_steps = [d['steps'] for d in all_data if d.get('reward', False)]\nif fail_steps:\n    print(f'\\n失败轨迹步数: mean={statistics.mean(fail_steps):.1f}, median={statistics.median(fail_steps):.0f}, min={min(fail_steps)}, max={max(fail_steps)}')\n    bins = {'1-10': 0, '11-20': 0, '21-30': 0, '31-40': 0}\n    for s in fail_steps:\n        if s <= 10: bins['1-10'] += 1\n        elif s <= 20: bins['11-20'] += 1\n        elif s <= 30: bins['21-30'] += 1\n        else: bins['31-40'] += 1\n    print(f'  步数分布: {dict(bins)}')\nif succ_steps:\n    print(f'成功轨迹步数: mean={statistics.mean(succ_steps):.1f}, median={statistics.median(succ_steps):.0f}')\n\nprint(f'\\nP2 可行性预判:')\nprint(f'  当前失败率 {failure/max(total,1)*100:.0f}%, 3 GPU 各 300 条 → 预估总失败 ~{int(900*(failure/max(total,1)))} 条')\nprint(f'  按 v5 ~83% match rate → ~{int(900*(failure/max(total,1))*0.83)} DPO pairs')\nPYEOF\n```\n\n### 产出\n简洁报告：整体 SR、per-GPU SR、task_type 分布、步数分析、P2 DPO pairs 预估。\n\n### 环境\n- 服务器：cqa1-21977\n- conda base\n- 项目路径：/root/autodl-tmp/rl-active-probe-fl\n\n### 轮询状态\n- 已轮询次数：1（本次是第 1 次）\n- 最大轮询次数：6\n- 上次数据：cuda0=27, cuda1=31, cuda4=24\n- ssh_read_only 不支持 shell 元字符(; && | > $())，用以下方式检查行数：\n  1. `wc -l /root/autodl-tmp/rl-active-probe-fl/data/trajectories_v9_icl_cuda0/train_part0.jsonl /root/autodl-tmp/rl-active-probe-fl/data/trajectories_v9_icl_cuda1/train_part1.jsonl /root/autodl-tmp/rl-active-probe-fl/data/trajectories_v9_icl_cuda4/train_part2.jsonl`\n  2. 详细分析需要用 ssh_execute 执行 python 脚本（ssh_read_only 不允许 open()）"
              },
              "caller": {
